PummeloIsland_2_Text_1:
	.string "Do you know the ’guardian of the\n"
	.string "island’?\p"
	.string "I heard DRAKE obtained him in some\n"
	.string "very warm and dry area.\p"
	.string "I wonder where that could be...$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_2:
	.string "Most POKéMON trainers need more\n"
	.string "experience before they battle\l"
	.string "DRAKE in PUMMELO STADIUM.\p"
	.string "They often go to the islands\n"
	.string "northeast of PUMMELO ISLAND.$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_3:
	.string "DRAKE has been the ORANGE LEAGUE\n"
	.string "CHAMPION for years!\p"
	.string "His strong and diverse team of\n"
	.string "POKéMON helped him achieve that.$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_4:
	.string "Cool! You’ve got all four ORANGE\n"
	.string "LEAGUE GYM BADGES!$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_5:
	.string "Wow!\n"
	.string "PUMMELO STADIUM is huge!$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_6:
	.string "I came all the way from KANTO to\n"
	.string "see the next WINNER’s TROPHY match\l"
	.string "in PUMMELO STADIUM!$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_7:
	.string "PUMMELO ISLAND \n"
	.string "Home of the ORANGE LEAGUE$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_8:
	.string "PUMMELO STADIUM$"

PummeloIsland_2_Text_9:
